    lines=['# Phase1 decay-performance lane','', 'The measured arithmetic route is now projected at a few minutes per constant. These are **C projections**, not measured complete banks. Fresh source-moment preparation, shared inputs/tables, real macro checks, an actual endpoint rule and energy blocks are included. Generic analytic soundness and `HasDecay` assembly remain Phase2/3 work.','', '| Constant | Basis/physical pieces | Degree | Candidate mu F | mu loss F | Finite cover cells E | Kernel projection C | With50% work reserve C |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
