    lines +=['','## Policy','', '- Use signed source-cluster multipoles of order12, query logjets of order8, and near-only endpoint modulus bounds. Recheck adjacent unions of at most8cells, crossing no polygon corner. A macro is checked once; the fullcover totals already count accepted macros and must not be divided by the four-cell example again.', '- Share checked lognodes j/64 and atan nodes j/128, use ten residual-series terms behind a checked1/128guard, and retain checked supplied binary exponents. The Phase0 evaluator already supplied/checked its exponent, so no new exponent speedup is claimed. Generic log/atan addition and tail soundness remain to be formalized in Phase2.', '- Bank-candidate proposals: chi3 14basis pieces degree3; thirds13degree3; fifths20degree4; lambda24degree4. The lambda20piece proposal met the floating.01cutoff but left too little continuum-debit margin; one justified24piece refinement reduced its mu loss from.009165 to.001451. All earlier controls are preserved. The general signeddegree4 and generalgeometry theorem domains are unchanged.', '- Prepare source raw moments once and translate them for every tree node, using factored integer scales. Do not recompute original piece integrals at every macro. Emit at most8macros per production file, keeping one declaration per point/input/row; this limits import overhead without merging a large live proof graph.', '- Use weight-aware energy precision: the hard pilot needs50digits/96terms for width below1e-18; choose lesser precision only after its actual coefficient/error amplification is checked.','', '## Scope and remaining work','', 'The kernel projections count all newly measured arithmetic components rather than a cached leaf alone: fresh node table, generic arithmetic, fullsource moment tree, each realmacro data+row check, endpoint control, and conservative energy/cap blocks. Existing Lean/compiler infrastructure is the common host baseline. Generic analytic theorem costs, their source adapters and final bank assembly are still unmeasured; this lane does not certify a complete final kernel budget or bank a new mu bound. The target is achievable for certificate arithmetic on this host, while the full theorem route must be measured after those modules exist.', '', 'The nine target rows retain their own exact frame/selector/content contexts. Equal leading analytic rate data and costs are replayed only after geometry, alpha, gamma, polecount and exact price agree. This creates F proposals, never a source/NV/content theorem transfer.', '', 'Every heavy job ran under the shared guard. Python solvers used explicit one-thread BLAS and staged1→2→5workers after measured~205–252MiB worker peaks. Cover controls were preserved through their worklimits; future refill was lowered to6, and the fastworker class used1GiB after observed~34MiB peaks and a bounded moment-cache analysis. No live ledger was edited and no unrelated process was killed. All own numerical queues have drained. Final build memory observations use creation-bound-v2; older PPID-only wrapper RSS is diagnostic only.','', 'Evidence and exact logs are linked in `COST-MODEL.json`. Source/replay artifacts, old failures and all earlier candidate controls remain in this evidence directory. No public root, release checkout, comparator, README, paper or remote branch was changed.']
